    <string name="service_label">Respire: pause before apps</string>
    <string name="service_description">Respire detects which app comes to the foreground to show a pause before the apps you chose. If you turn on the Reels or Shorts filter, it also checks the technical IDs of on-screen elements, only in Instagram and YouTube, to spot the short-video player. Nothing is stored or sent: the app has no Internet access.</string>
